@host = http://localhost:5037

GET {{host}}/api/locations

### Browse requests
GET {{host}}/api/requests?status=Draft&page=1&pageSize=10

### Create a draft
POST {{host}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": 1,
  "priority": "Urgent",
  "items": [
    { "articleNumber": "BOLT-M8", "description": "M8 steel bolts", "requestedQuantity": 20 }
  ]
}

### Set this to the ID returned by create
@requestId = 16

POST {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/submit

### Poll until validationStatus changes from Pending
GET {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}

### Approve after validationStatus is Available
POST {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/approve

### Use the item's ID from the GET response
POST {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/fulfill
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "itemId": 31, "quantity": 20 }] }

### Alternative: reject a Submitted request
POST {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Duplicate request" }
